# Istio Service Mesh Configuration for Manchester Tokenization

This directory contains Istio-specific Kubernetes resource definitions for configuring the service mesh, including mutual TLS (mTLS) policies and access control.

## Applying Configurations

To apply the mTLS and access control configurations to your Kubernetes cluster, use the following commands:

```bash
kubectl apply -f mtls-enable.yaml
kubectl apply -f access-control.yaml
```

These commands deploy the configurations to enforce strict mTLS across the service mesh and define access control policies based on service identities and request attributes.
